# Fiaker: Salzburg horse-drawn carriage charging LEFT (no mirror).
# Horse O/l with d mane/tail and hooves, a small green Tyrolean hat (G/j) with
# a white feather between the ears; coachman with d bowler hat and l coat on
# the box; black lacquered carriage d/m with o trim, folded hood, wheels with
# o spokes. Drawn in a scratch generator (shapes + automatic k outline), then
# frozen to text here.
sprite = fiaker
size   = 48x32
origin = 24,32
hitbox = 2,4,44,28
anim   = idle      frames=2 ticks=30 loop
anim   = telegraph frames=2 ticks=6 loop
anim   = charge    frames=2 ticks=6 loop
